  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interpreter for Project Activities: Indonesia Digital Health and Workforce Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is for interpreter and translation services for project on Indonesia Digital Health and Workforce Development with NHS Consortium for Global Health. The interpreters are highly required for year 2 activities that will include Communities of Practice for different categories of stroke care professions and policymakers, Actions Learning Sets, and adaptation of Fundamentals of Acute Care and Treatment after Stroke (FACTS) e-module. The participants from all these activities are all Indonesian healthcare workforce, from doctors, nurses, therapists, and policy makers.</narrative>
  </description>
